{"4229580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Am Bird", "steam_appid": 4229580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Play as a Super Bird</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Am Bird </strong>puts you in the wings of a true bird hero. Fly freely through a large city full of quests, activities, and exploration. Experience the life of a super-bird from above as you glide through streets, rooftops, and open skies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a big, open city filled with activities. The city becomes your playground as you fly wherever you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Protect the City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help citizens or your bird crew from danger, and take heroic tasks across the city. Roam the streets and look for justice. Dive, strike, and use your gadgets to keep the city safe from above.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Super Bird Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly, glide, dash, and maneuver. Perform fast turns, sharp dives, and heroic aerial attacks using your unique bird powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Gadgets &amp; Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with a variety of tools designed for a bird hero. Use gadgets to fight enemies, distract threats, solve quests, and assist citizens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Dozens of Activities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover side missions, challenges, and fun tasks around the city. From aerial races to rescue missions, every district offers something new to explore.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Play as a Super Bird</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Am Bird </strong>puts you in the wings of a true bird hero. Fly freely through a large city full of quests, activities, and exploration. Experience the life of a super-bird from above as you glide through streets, rooftops, and open skies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a big, open city filled with activities. The city becomes your playground as you fly wherever you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Protect the City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help citizens or your bird crew from danger, and take heroic tasks across the city. Roam the streets and look for justice. Dive, strike, and use your gadgets to keep the city safe from above.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Super Bird Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly, glide, dash, and maneuver. Perform fast turns, sharp dives, and heroic aerial attacks using your unique bird powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Gadgets &amp; Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with a variety of tools designed for a bird hero. Use gadgets to fight enemies, distract threats, solve quests, and assist citizens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Dozens of Activities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover side missions, challenges, and fun tasks around the city. From aerial races to rescue missions, every district offers something new to explore.</p>", "short_description": "Play as a Super Bird Spread wings. Save the city. Play as a bird hero — the city is your playground. Fly through the streets, help citizens and your bird crew. Keep danger away. Fly, glide, and maneuver through the skies and streets. Protect the city using unique skills and gadgets.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229580/5f6ee1d6220a68ccc00917744ff898ae30589a72/header.jpg?t=1764927986", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps